# The loci step 53 genotypes with Locityper (docs/53-locityper.md), GRCh38, BED (0-based start).
# Columns: chrom, start, end, locus name. The regions are those of the Locityper authors' own
# GRCh38 database of 326 loci (Zenodo 15879519, db.tar.gz, ref.bed of each locus), except FCGR,
# their FCGR3A and FCGR2B loci joined because they overlap. setup.sh --locityper-data builds the
# database of these rows from the HPRC v2.1 pangenome VCF (LOCITYPER_PANEL_URL) and reads that VCF
# 250 kb either side of each row, the room Locityper's locus extension needs (up to 200 kb).
chr1	161506761	161681047	FCGR
chr6	32484347	32593538	HLA-DRB1
chr6	32652603	32669077	HLA-DQB1
chr19	54723153	54868521	KIR
